---
import '../styles/site.css';

const explorerUrl = 'https://explorer.solana.com/?cluster=devnet';
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Wutzcoin (WUTZ): a valueless Solana Devnet fun and learning token." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0014" />
    <link rel="icon" href={`${baseUrl}favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>Wutzcoin — $WUTZ on Solana Devnet</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="acid-noise" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="site-header shell">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Wutzcoin home">
        <img src={`${baseUrl}favicon.svg`} alt="Wutzcoin logo" width="48" height="48" />
        <span>WUTZCOIN</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="#token">Token</a>
        <a href="#roadmap">Timeline</a>
        <a href="#airdrop">Airdrop</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="language-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch to German" data-language-toggle>DE</button>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero shell">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" data-en>DEVNET ONLY · ZERO VALUE · MAXIMUM WUTZ</p>
          <p class="eyebrow" data-de>NUR DEVNET · WERTLOS · MAXIMAL WUTZ</p>
          <h1 data-en>THE COIN<br /><span>GOES WUTZ.</span></h1>
          <h1 data-de>DIE COIN<br /><span>GEHT WUTZ.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy" data-en>Wutzcoin is a deliberately valueless Token-2022 experiment on Solana Devnet. It is not for buying, selling, trading, or believing in.</p>
          <p class="hero-copy" data-de>Wutzcoin ist ein bewusst wertloses Token-2022-Experiment auf Solana Devnet. Nicht zum Kaufen, Verkaufen, Handeln oder Glauben.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-hot" href={explorerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-en>OPEN DEVNET EXPLORER ↗</a>
            <a class="button button-hot" href={explorerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-de>DEVNET EXPLORER ÖFFNEN ↗</a>
            <a class="button button-plain" href="#warning" data-en>READ THE WARNING</a>
            <a class="button button-plain" href="#warning" data-de>WARNUNG LESEN</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-sticker" aria-label="Wutzcoin token image">
          <img src={`${baseUrl}wutzcoin-token.png`} alt="Pixel Wutzcoin token" />
          <strong>$WUTZ</strong>
          <small data-en>not a number go up thing</small>
          <small data-de>kein Zahl-geht-hoch-Ding</small>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="ticker" aria-label="Wutzcoin characteristics">
        <span>NO MAINNET</span><span>NO SALE</span><span>NO LIQUIDITY</span><span>NO DEX</span><span>NO WALLET CONNECT</span><span>NO PROMISES</span>
      </section>

      <section id="token" class="shell section-grid">
        <article class="panel panel-dark">
          <p class="panel-label">TOKEN FACTS / TOKEN-FAKTEN</p>
          <h2 data-en>ONE HUNDRED SEXTILLION, VISUALLY.</h2>
          <h2 data-de>EINHUNDERT TRILLIARDEN, OPTISCH.</h2>
          <p data-en>The raw on-chain balance is intentionally within Solana's <code>u64</code> limit. A Token-2022 display multiplier makes compatible clients show the theatrical number below.</p>
          <p data-de>Der Rohbestand auf der Chain bleibt absichtlich innerhalb von Solanas <code>u64</code>-Grenze. Ein Token-2022-Anzeigemultiplikator zeigt kompatiblen Clients die theatralische Zahl unten.</p>
          <dl class="token-data">
            <div><dt>Network</dt><dd>Solana Devnet</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Program</dt><dd>Token-2022</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Symbol</dt><dd>$WUTZ</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Raw supply</dt><dd>100,000,000,000,000</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Decimals</dt><dd>0</dd></div>
            <div><dt>UI multiplier</dt><dd>1,000,000,000</dd></div>
            <div class="wide"><dt>Displayed supply</dt><dd>100,000,000,000,000,000,000,000 WUTZ</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </article>
        <article class="panel panel-light">
          <p class="panel-label">STATUS / STATUS</p>
          <h2 data-en>PRE-MINT CHECKLIST</h2>
          <h2 data-de>VOR-MINT-CHECKLISTE</h2>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li data-en>Website and public metadata: online</li><li data-de>Website und öffentliche Metadaten: online</li>
            <li data-en>Network: Solana Devnet only</li><li data-de>Netzwerk: ausschließlich Solana Devnet</li>
            <li data-en>Mint: awaiting owner confirmation</li><li data-de>Mint: wartet auf Owner-Bestätigung</li>
            <li data-en>Mint and freeze authorities: will be disabled</li><li data-de>Mint- und Freeze-Authorities: werden deaktiviert</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="text-link" href={explorerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-en>Inspect the Devnet cluster ↗</a>
          <a class="text-link" href={explorerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-de>Devnet-Cluster prüfen ↗</a>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="roadmap" class="shell section-block">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">FICTION, CLEARLY LABELLED / FIKTION, KLAR MARKIERT</p>
          <h2 data-en>THE ABSOLUTELY FICTIONAL PROJECT CHRONICLE</h2>
          <h2 data-de>DIE ABSOLUT FIKTIVE PROJEKTCHRONIK</h2>
          <p data-en>This is a playful imagined timeline, not a record of past events, milestones, users, partners, listings, or promises.</p>
          <p data-de>Das ist eine spielerische Fantasie-Zeitleiste, kein Bericht über vergangene Events, Meilensteine, Nutzende, Partner, Listings oder Zusagen.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="timeline">
          <li><b>T+0</b><span data-en>A pixel says “WUTZ.” Someone writes it down.</span><span data-de>Ein Pixel sagt „WUTZ.“ Jemand schreibt es auf.</span></li>
          <li><b>T+1</b><span data-en>The token discovers Devnet, not the market.</span><span data-de>Der Token entdeckt Devnet, nicht den Markt.</span></li>
          <li><b>T+2</b><span data-en>A simulated confetti machine reaches unreasonable levels.</span><span data-de>Eine simulierte Konfettimaschine erreicht unvernünftige Ausmaße.</span></li>
          <li><b>T+∞</b><span data-en>The experiment remains an experiment.</span><span data-de>Das Experiment bleibt ein Experiment.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section id="airdrop" class="shell callout">
        <div>
          <p class="panel-label">AIRDROP / AIRDROP</p>
          <h2 data-en>NO AIRDROP IS LIVE.</h2>
          <h2 data-de>KEIN AIRDROP IST AKTIV.</h2>
          <p data-en>There is no claim page, wallet connection, form, social channel, or eligibility list. Treat anything claiming otherwise as fake.</p>
          <p data-de>Es gibt keine Claim-Seite, Wallet-Verbindung, Formulare, Social-Kanäle oder Berechtigungsliste. Alles Gegenteilige ist fake.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fake-stamp" aria-hidden="true">NO<br />CLAIM</div>
      </section>

      <section id="warning" class="shell warning">
        <img src={`${baseUrl}favicon.svg`} alt="" width="52" height="52" />
        <div>
          <h2 data-en>A serious note.</h2><h2 data-de>Eine ernste Anmerkung.</h2>
          <p data-en>WUTZ is a technical fun and learning project on Solana Devnet. It has no guaranteed or expected monetary value, grants no rights, is not offered for sale, and must not be exchanged for real SOL or money. The scaled UI amount is cosmetic; incompatible clients may show only the raw supply.</p>
          <p data-de>WUTZ ist ein technisches Spaß- und Lernprojekt auf Solana Devnet. Es hat keinen garantierten oder erwarteten Geldwert, verleiht keine Rechte, wird nicht verkauft und darf nicht gegen echtes SOL oder Geld getauscht werden. Der skalierte UI-Betrag ist kosmetisch; inkompatible Clients zeigen möglicherweise nur den Rohbestand.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer shell">
      <img src={`${baseUrl}favicon.svg`} alt="Wutzcoin logo" width="34" height="34" />
      <span>WUTZCOIN · SOLANA DEVNET · NO MONETARY VALUE</span>
      <a href="https://wutz.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">wutz.io ↗</a>
    </footer>

    <script>
      const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-language-toggle]');
      const root = document.documentElement;
      if (button) {
        const setLanguage = (language: 'en' | 'de') => {
          root.lang = language;
          root.dataset.language = language;
          button.textContent = language === 'en' ? 'DE' : 'EN';
          button.setAttribute('aria-label', language === 'en' ? 'Switch to German' : 'Zu Englisch wechseln');
        };
        setLanguage('en');
        button.addEventListener('click', () => setLanguage(root.dataset.language === 'en' ? 'de' : 'en'));
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
